  "solution": {
    "text": "These are 10 letters in the word IRRATIONAL in which these are $2^{4} I, 2 \\cdot R^{\\prime}$ and $2 \\cdot A^{\\prime}$\r\n$\\therefore$ The total number of word $s=\\frac{10 !}{2 ! 2 ! 2 !}=\\frac{10 !}{(21)^{3}}$",
